<p>Your melee and ranged attacks inflict distracting wounds that reduce the target’s critical strike multiplier by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 33%, 42%, 48%, 53%</acronym> for 5 turns. </p><p>In addition, your attacks have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 17%, 22%, 26%, 30%</acronym> chance to inflict a painful wound that causes them to forget a random talent for 4 turns.  The last effect cannot occur more than once per turn per target.</p><p></p>